            <dt>Action</dt>
            <dd>A connected client has the agent call its code execution tool.</dd>
            <dt>Defect</dt>
            <dd>The call reaches the runtime with no approval boundary.</dd>
            <dt>Effective control</dt>
            <dd>The runtime refuses the call without valid authority for that exact call.</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

